SUMMARY:Parent Academy - September: Starting Strong: Helping Your Child Thrive This School Year
DESCRIPTION:The beginning of a new school year is filled with excitement\, change\, and new opportunities—but it can also bring stress and uncertainty for both children and parents. This interactive presentation provides caregivers with practical\, research-informed strategies to help children build confidence\, establish healthy routines\, manage stress\, strengthen relationships\, and succeed academically throughout the school year. Parents will leave with actionable tools they can begin using the very next day\, regardless of their child’s age.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/parent-academy-september-starting-strong-helping-your-child-thrive-this-school-year/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
